WHAT TO LOOK FOR
────────────────
The giveaway is usually in the language. Words in a hostname that
mark something as staff-only:

    internal     private      staging     legacy
    admin        old          backup      test

If any of those words show up on a host that's visible from the
outside, somebody screwed up. That's your target.

WHERE TO LOOK
─────────────
Scan hostnames -- but also the lines right under each hostname.
Most hosts here have nothing between their name and their port
list. One does. That's the giveaway.

HOW TO SUBMIT
─────────────
Type the hostname or the IP at the prompt, hit Enter:

    10.4.12.88
    jenkins-old
